@startuml Sequence - Ack Command
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

participant "IoT Device (Router)" as Router #DDFFDD
participant "router-manager-service\ngRPC Server" as Grpc #BBFFFF
participant "Security Middleware" as Sec #FFDDDD
participant "Command Repository" as CmdRepo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB #DDFFDD
participant "Metrics" as Metrics #FFEECC
participant "Logger" as Logger #EEFFEE
participant "Tracer" as Tracer #CCCCFF

== Роутер подтверждает выполнение команды (Ack) ==

Router -> Grpc: gRPC AckCommand{router_id, command_id, result?, error?}\n[mTLS + IP Whitelist]
activate Router
activate Grpc

Grpc -> Tracer: Start span "ack-command"\n(trace_id, span_id, command_id, router_id)
activate Tracer
Tracer --> Grpc: span context
deactivate Tracer

Grpc -> Sec: Check: IP Whitelist, Rate Limit, mTLS cert
activate Sec
Sec --> Grpc: OK / Error(403)
deactivate Sec

alt Проверка не пройдена
    Grpc -> Tracer: Record error "permission_denied"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> Grpc: recorded
    deactivate Tracer

    Grpc --> Router: gRPC error (PERMISSION_DENIED)
    deactivate Grpc
    deactivate Router
else Проверка успешна
    Grpc -> Tracer: Start span "acknowledge-command"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> Grpc: child span
    deactivate Tracer

    Grpc -> CmdRepo: AcknowledgeCommand(command_id, router_id, status)\n[span context]
    activate CmdRepo

    ' === АТОМАРНОСТЬ: проверка + обновление в одной транзакции ===
    CmdRepo -> DB: BEGIN
    activate DB

    CmdRepo -> Tracer: Start span "db-select-command"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> CmdRepo: child span
    deactivate Tracer

    CmdRepo -> DB: SELECT router_id, status FROM commands WHERE id=$1 FOR UPDATE
    activate DB
    DB --> CmdRepo: command_row{router_id, status}
    deactivate DB

    CmdRepo -> Tracer: End span "db-select-command"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> CmdRepo: ended
    deactivate Tracer

    alt Команда найдена и принадлежит роутеру
        alt Статус = SENT (ожидаем ack)
            CmdRepo -> Tracer: Start span "db-update-acked"
            activate Tracer
            Tracer --> CmdRepo: child span
            deactivate Tracer

            CmdRepo -> DB: UPDATE commands \nSET status='ACKED', acked_at=NOW(), result=$2 \nWHERE id=$1 AND router_id=$2
            activate DB
            DB --> CmdRepo: rows_updated=1
            deactivate DB

            CmdRepo -> Tracer: End span "db-update-acked"
            activate Tracer
            Tracer --> CmdRepo: ended
            deactivate Tracer

            CmdRepo -> DB: COMMIT
            deactivate DB

            par Логирование и метрики
                CmdRepo -> Logger: Log: "Command acked"\n{command_id, router_id, status=ACKED}\n[trace_id]
                activate Logger
                Logger --> CmdRepo: logged
                deactivate Logger

                CmdRepo -> Metrics: Inc: commands_acked_total{type, router_id}
                activate Metrics
                Metrics --> CmdRepo: metric updated
                deactivate Metrics

                CmdRepo -> Metrics: Observe: ack_latency_seconds{type}
                activate Metrics
                Metrics --> CmdRepo: observed
                deactivate Metrics
            end

            CmdRepo -> Tracer: Set span attribute "status=ACKED"
            activate Tracer
            Tracer --> CmdRepo: attributes set
            deactivate Tracer

            CmdRepo -> Tracer: End span "acknowledge-command"
            activate Tracer
            Tracer --> CmdRepo: ended
            deactivate Tracer

            CmdRepo --> Grpc: nil (success)
        else Статус ≠ SENT или router_id не совпадает
            CmdRepo -> DB: ROLLBACK
            deactivate DB

            CmdRepo -> Tracer: Record error "invalid_state"
            activate Tracer
            Tracer --> CmdRepo: recorded
            deactivate Tracer

            CmdRepo -> Tracer: End span "acknowledge-command"
            activate Tracer
            Tracer --> CmdRepo: ended
            deactivate Tracer

            CmdRepo -> Logger: Log: "Ack rejected"\n{command_id, reason="invalid_state"}\n[trace_id]
            activate Logger
            Logger --> CmdRepo: logged
            deactivate Logger
            CmdRepo --> Grpc: error (INVALID_STATE)
        end
    else Команда не найдена
        CmdRepo -> DB: ROLLBACK
        deactivate DB

        CmdRepo -> Tracer: Record error "not_found"
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> CmdRepo: recorded
        deactivate Tracer

        CmdRepo -> Tracer: End span "acknowledge-command"
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> CmdRepo: ended
        deactivate Tracer

        CmdRepo -> Logger: Log: "Ack failed"\n{command_id, reason="not_found"}\n[trace_id]
        activate Logger
        Logger --> CmdRepo: logged
        deactivate Logger
        CmdRepo --> Grpc: error (NOT_FOUND)
    end

    deactivate CmdRepo

    Grpc -> Tracer: Export spans to Alloy\n[OTLP/gRPC: trace_id, spans[]]
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> Grpc: exported
    deactivate Tracer

    alt Успех
        Grpc --> Router: gRPC AckResponse{status: "ACKED"}
        deactivate Grpc
        deactivate Router
    else Ошибка
        Grpc --> Router: gRPC error (NOT_FOUND / INVALID_STATE)
        deactivate Grpc
        deactivate Router
    end
end

note right of DB
  Полный цикл команды:
  PENDING (create) → SENT (poll) → ACKED/FAILED (ack)

  Атомарность: проверка владельца +
  обновление статуса в одной транзакции
  предотвращает race conditions.
end note

note right of Metrics
  Observability:
  • commands_acked_total{type, router_id, result}
  • commands_failed_total{type, router_id}
  • ack_latency_seconds{type} — время от SENT до ACKED
  • command_lifecycle_duration_seconds — полный цикл
end note

note right of Tracer
  Tracing:
  • trace_id: уникальный ID ack-запроса
  • span "acknowledge-command": основная операция
  • span "db-select-command": проверка команды
  • span "db-update-acked": обновление статуса
  • attributes: command_id, router_id, status, result
  • Export: OTLP/gRPC → Alloy → Tempo
end note
@enduml